      "Verify actual culture-medium viscosity (0.9–1.1e-3 Pa·s); a 10% viscosity change shifts shear ~10%.",
      "Confirm channel cross-section is truly rectangular and measure the fabricated width/height — shear scales as 1/(w·h²), so fabrication tolerance matters.",
